# Recipe 13 — Paperless-ngx Archivist
# Copy to .env. Token must belong to a DEDICATED user with VIEW-only
# permissions (Admin → Users & Groups). Never your admin token.
# Paperless-ngx 2.x? Pin the 3.1.1 server image instead (see README).
PAPERLESS_URL=http://paperless.local:8000
PAPERLESS_API_KEY=change-me-view-only-user-token
